<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Prompt for Chinese Mathematical Corpus</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A1.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ Appendix A Prompt for Chinese Mathematical Corpus ‣ More Data or Better Data? A Critical Analysis of Data Selection and Synthesis for Mathematical Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <a href="#A1.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ Appendix A Prompt for Chinese Mathematical Corpus ‣ More Data or Better Data? A Critical Analysis of Data Selection and Synthesis for Mathematical Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> illustrates the prompt we use to construct Chinese mathematical pretraining data.</p>
</div>
