<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Pretraining Datasets</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ B.2 Pretraining Datasets ‣ Appendix B Detailed Experimental Results ‣ More Data or Better Data? A Critical Analysis of Data Selection and Synthesis for Mathematical Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> illustrates the detailed performance of models pretrained on the <span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Math-Cosmo</span> dataset. As shown in table, our synthesized dataset lead to improvements in the model’s mathematical reasoning ability, thereby demonstrating the effectiveness of rewriting data into interpretable format.</p>
</div>
